description.narrative:
Strengthening APOINME's institutional capacities and promoting the defense of indigenous peoples' rights and territories in APOINME's area of ??coverage (States of Minas Gerais, Espírito Santo, and from the Northeast region). The project has as its main objectives: 
1) Strengthen and expand the Organization's capacities, as well as its political and legal influence in the defense of indigenous peoples rights and territories; 
2) Enhance the action of women and youth, promoting leaders and actions in defense of indigenous women's and youth rights; 
3) Empowering the Microregions to implement actions aimed at the well-being of the peoples and territories of the region, through cooperation, communication, and training; 
4) Contribute to the protection of the environment and tackling climate change.
